WEBVTT

00:01.620 --> 00:04.500
A space colony...? Emigrants...?

00:04.500 --> 00:06.160
That's right, Vash.

00:06.160 --> 00:10.490
We left Earth two hundred years ago
 in search of a new home.

00:10.490 --> 00:13.690
Like a Western... 
Life on the frontier!

00:13.690 --> 00:14.740
Huh?

00:14.740 --> 00:18.240
Where cowboys stand up for their friends
and beat the bad guys!

00:18.240 --> 00:19.410
Bang, bang!

00:19.410 --> 00:22.260
I don't like that stuff.

00:23.440 --> 00:25.580
Look, you two.

00:26.130 --> 00:31.140
Project Seeds means hope, 
a future for humanity and plants.

00:31.640 --> 00:35.220
How come we're the only ones
who can live outside the casings?

00:36.210 --> 00:38.540
Here's what I think.

00:38.540 --> 00:43.010
Maybe you two are gifts sent by God

00:43.010 --> 00:47.020
to act as a bridge between humans and plants.

00:47.020 --> 00:48.910
Like angels.

00:48.910 --> 00:52.030
I wonder if we can get along with humans.

00:52.720 --> 00:57.530
Don't worry. No matter 
what happens, I will protect you.

00:58.840 --> 01:00.040
Always.

01:02.290 --> 01:08.430
We the Independents will bring 
a new order to this world.

01:08.430 --> 01:10.830
It's the birth of a new world!

01:10.830 --> 01:15.050
<i>This is a Satellite News Flash 
from November Public Broadcasting!</i>

01:15.050 --> 01:18.680
<i>The unknown object that suddenly 
appeared in central JuLai</i>

01:18.680 --> 01:21.870
<i>is continuing to grow at an astounding pace!</i>

01:23.070 --> 01:25.230
It's the end of the world.

01:26.490 --> 01:29.590
Knives has gone to the other side of the gate.

01:29.590 --> 01:31.300
The other side of the gate?

01:31.300 --> 01:35.500
A realm in the higher dimension 
that we cannot possibly fathom.

01:35.500 --> 01:38.870
There, he will connect 
directly with the plant core.

01:43.920 --> 01:49.690
He will artificially impregnate all of the 
plants and create new Independents,

01:49.690 --> 01:52.560
similar to how he and Vash were born.

01:53.420 --> 01:58.630
Then he will wipe out humanity
 and create a new world.

01:59.220 --> 02:02.700
Are you saying he's going 
to kill us if this goes on?

02:03.470 --> 02:06.100
Wake up, Vash!

02:06.100 --> 02:11.050
I already told you that he's no longer 
the Vash the Stampede you knew.

02:12.470 --> 02:13.570
Accept it.

02:14.010 --> 02:17.460
The gate is already open, 
with Vash as the hub.

02:17.950 --> 02:21.990
The only way to close it now 
would be to destroy the gate itself.

02:22.460 --> 02:24.950
In other words, to kill Vash.

02:24.950 --> 02:26.450
That can't be...

02:27.250 --> 02:28.330
I made it.

02:32.010 --> 02:33.480
I can feel it!

02:34.740 --> 02:37.470
This is the power that was 
inside you all this time.

02:38.520 --> 02:41.050
Now, let us begin!

02:42.090 --> 02:45.220
<i>This is JuLai requesting
 backup from the Alliance of Cities!</i>

02:45.740 --> 02:47.410
What's going on?!

02:47.410 --> 02:49.680
There's no end to it!

03:03.910 --> 03:05.230
You're not going to run?

03:05.230 --> 03:08.510
At this rate, the twins 
will take the whole planet.

03:08.510 --> 03:12.210
It's not every day I get to see you flustered.

03:12.210 --> 03:14.170
Things not going to plan?

03:15.000 --> 03:18.620
It's really too bad. If you 
had a network of your own,

03:18.620 --> 03:21.430
you could've made death obsolete.

03:21.430 --> 03:23.890
Humans aren't like Worms.

03:23.890 --> 03:26.310
And I reckon this'll be the end of you.

03:29.810 --> 03:31.480
For cryin' out loud.

03:36.450 --> 03:39.190
The only one who can 
stop Millions Knives is...

03:40.830 --> 03:42.840
He has been reborn.

03:42.840 --> 03:44.500
As a plant.

03:52.180 --> 03:55.690
Human words mean nothing to him anymore.

03:57.510 --> 04:00.970
But what is he trying to start?

04:06.970 --> 04:09.800
You must run! It'll swallow you up!

04:11.390 --> 04:13.350
Don't you give up now!

04:13.760 --> 04:17.770
You're the only one who 
can stop Millions Knives!

04:17.770 --> 04:20.200
Come on... Vash!

04:24.550 --> 04:27.550
I know you can hear me, Vash!

04:25.190 --> 04:27.550
She doesn't know when to quit.

04:31.210 --> 04:33.000
Pathetic.

04:33.000 --> 04:35.540
A parasite feeding off our brethren.

04:35.960 --> 04:38.010
This power belongs to us.

04:38.560 --> 04:40.170
I won't let any human have it!

04:41.070 --> 04:41.800
Vash!

04:42.550 --> 04:44.160
Vash!

04:52.550 --> 04:53.710
What's that song?

04:54.450 --> 04:56.240
It just comes to me.

04:56.240 --> 04:59.360
It calms me down when I'm nervous.

04:59.360 --> 05:02.040
I feel like I know it from long ago.

05:02.040 --> 05:03.550
Hm...

05:03.550 --> 05:08.210
Say, Nai, do you think we 
can get along with humans?

05:08.210 --> 05:11.960
Don't worry. No matter 
what happens, I will protect you.

05:18.220 --> 05:19.370
<i>Vash.</i>

05:20.470 --> 05:21.630
<i>Vash...</i>

05:27.890 --> 05:30.020
I will protect you.

05:30.020 --> 05:31.040
No...

05:32.100 --> 05:35.250
No! You're not the one who said that!

05:39.270 --> 05:42.030
The person who said that to me is...

05:44.560 --> 05:45.640
Vash.

05:51.170 --> 05:54.160
You'll be so much happier if you stay here.

05:54.480 --> 05:57.040
Don't go. Don't go!

05:57.960 --> 06:00.700
Vash! Stop!

06:02.740 --> 06:05.870
<i>Vash... Vash...</i>

06:15.640 --> 06:16.650
<i>Vash...</i>

06:17.970 --> 06:19.130
<i>Vash.</i>

06:20.640 --> 06:21.810
<i>Vash.</i>

06:23.450 --> 06:24.440
Wait!

06:25.640 --> 06:26.610
Please wait!

06:29.610 --> 06:30.910
Rem!

06:31.720 --> 06:34.010
<i>I'm sorry I left you all alone.</i>

06:34.980 --> 06:38.800
<i>But I'm glad to know 
I've lived on inside you all this time.</i>

06:39.690 --> 06:44.330
<i>Thank you for protecting 
my dreams and my hopes...</i>

06:44.330 --> 06:45.430
<i>Vash.</i>

06:45.900 --> 06:48.790
Vash? Vash...

06:48.790 --> 06:49.800
Vash!

06:52.140 --> 06:53.180
What?

06:54.040 --> 06:55.270
The power...

06:55.270 --> 06:56.600
It's flowing in reverse!

07:07.850 --> 07:08.940
I was rejected!

07:09.490 --> 07:11.360
What's going on, Doctor?!

07:14.290 --> 07:16.080
The gate is closing...

07:16.080 --> 07:19.090
The energy from the 
higher plane is converging.

07:28.300 --> 07:29.750
Vash...

07:30.440 --> 07:32.420
So you think you've outplayed me?

07:34.180 --> 07:37.180
Pathetic human!

07:44.090 --> 07:46.160
Thank you, Meryl.

07:53.080 --> 07:55.560
I heard your voice, too.

08:08.910 --> 08:13.030
He's controlling that huge mass by himself?

08:16.450 --> 08:17.730
Vash...

08:21.640 --> 08:23.050
Vash...

08:23.520 --> 08:24.390
Nai.

08:25.160 --> 08:27.240
Your plan has failed.

08:28.170 --> 08:29.840
Now let's end this.

08:29.840 --> 08:30.980
It's not over.

08:30.980 --> 08:33.050
I won't let it be!

08:33.050 --> 08:36.810
Give that to me!

08:36.810 --> 08:38.620
Vash!

08:49.170 --> 08:51.870
Take me there again!

08:53.590 --> 08:56.010
Back to the higher dimension!

09:04.920 --> 09:07.020
It didn't converge?

09:07.020 --> 09:09.390
He refined it on a molecular level?

09:09.390 --> 09:14.660
He broke it into countless particles, 
smaller than air, and crystallized it...

09:14.660 --> 09:17.070
But that won't last long!

09:17.670 --> 09:21.100
I need to get this someplace
 far away right now!

09:21.100 --> 09:24.030
Do you know what that is, Vash?!

09:39.910 --> 09:40.900
Vash!

09:40.900 --> 09:42.350
Wait!

10:01.940 --> 10:04.480
U-Undertaker!

10:04.480 --> 10:07.150
I'm just here to pay up for the cigarettes.

10:09.580 --> 10:10.640
Whoa!

10:11.770 --> 10:14.990
What kind of idiot challenges 
Millions Knives like that?

10:15.450 --> 10:17.640
He's way out of our league.

10:17.640 --> 10:19.310
Time to skedaddle!

10:19.310 --> 10:20.840
Do you see now?

10:20.840 --> 10:24.150
Our powers are on a whole different level.

10:24.150 --> 10:27.890
You think those puny humans 
could ever accept that?!

10:28.560 --> 10:33.150
They'll never allow those 
who threaten them to survive!

10:33.150 --> 10:35.820
You can bet they'll hunt us down in a frenzy!

10:43.640 --> 10:44.870
Ugh...

10:45.810 --> 10:48.150
Give it to me!

11:49.550 --> 11:51.950
There he is! It's the Humanoid Typhoon!

11:53.510 --> 11:54.820
Soldiers?!

11:54.820 --> 11:58.280
It's not safe here! You have to get away!

11:59.030 --> 12:02.120
Please, listen to me!

12:10.790 --> 12:14.630
It's not safe. You need to run.

12:16.050 --> 12:17.820
You're in danger!

12:17.820 --> 12:20.030
Don't let him get away! Open fire!

12:23.010 --> 12:26.450
If you hadn't shown up, 
nobody would have died!

12:26.450 --> 12:29.260
How many cities will you destroy 
before you're done?!

12:29.260 --> 12:31.510
Humanoid Typhoon!

12:34.280 --> 12:36.580
Run. Please run.

12:36.580 --> 12:38.140
You have to flee!

12:45.470 --> 12:46.950
It's like I already told you.

12:47.810 --> 12:53.060
Our powers are too great. 
Humans will never understand.

12:53.870 --> 12:56.680
They're neither friends nor family.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.890
They are our enemies.

12:58.890 --> 13:02.480
You're wrong. I... We can...

13:02.480 --> 13:03.920
We can get along!

13:03.920 --> 13:09.190
Your own actions contradict you!

13:17.100 --> 13:19.310
I know I'm contradicting myself.

13:20.060 --> 13:25.700
But even so, I won't give up
 until they believe in me.

13:25.700 --> 13:28.060
I'll do whatever it takes!

13:28.060 --> 13:30.280
I'll do everything I can!

13:56.560 --> 13:58.060
I knew it.

13:58.430 --> 14:01.740
Vash is trying to release 
the energy into outer space.

14:01.740 --> 14:04.070
What? But if he does that...

14:04.410 --> 14:06.380
it'll blast him to pieces!

14:13.080 --> 14:15.270
Releasing it into space?

14:15.270 --> 14:17.080
I won't let you!

14:23.250 --> 14:26.130
Doctor! Cut off the lab!

14:26.130 --> 14:27.880
Let them free!

14:28.880 --> 14:31.780
Let go, Nai! I can't hold it anymore!

14:31.780 --> 14:34.390
At this rate, it'll be the whole planet,
including the plants!

14:34.390 --> 14:37.840
What are you going to do, Knives? 
The gate is closed.

14:37.840 --> 14:39.900
I can't send you back to the plane!

14:40.940 --> 14:44.660
I'll push this energy back into Vash!

14:44.660 --> 14:49.400
I'll pry open the entrance 
to the higher dimension again!

14:49.890 --> 14:51.800
Vash!

14:51.800 --> 14:56.060
I'm telling you to hand it over!

14:59.540 --> 15:01.330
We're out of time!

15:01.890 --> 15:05.850
Listen to me, Vash! This is a war!

15:05.850 --> 15:08.920
Let's gather our allies, 
break free from the humans,

15:08.920 --> 15:12.370
and create a paradise for us Independents!

15:12.370 --> 15:14.220
It's the only way!

15:17.650 --> 15:22.050
Since when have we been so different?

15:23.290 --> 15:24.690
What are you talking about?

15:25.120 --> 15:29.690
You saw for yourself how they're running 
our brethren red and killing them off!

15:30.330 --> 15:34.270
The humans will never 
understand our Independence.

15:34.270 --> 15:37.710
They only see us as slaves!

15:37.710 --> 15:38.880
That's not true!

15:38.880 --> 15:40.330
Wake up, Vash!

15:40.330 --> 15:43.500
What's changed since 
that day a hundred years ago?

15:43.500 --> 15:44.380
You're wrong.

15:44.380 --> 15:47.040
How long will you remain the hunted?!

15:47.040 --> 15:50.520
Even if they hunt me, I'll just run away!

15:50.520 --> 15:55.640
I'll run, run, run, and keep running
 as far as I have to!

15:57.520 --> 16:01.060
And when things calm down, 
I'll quietly settle by their side again.

16:01.830 --> 16:05.740
I'm Vash the Stampede.

16:09.440 --> 16:12.470
After more than a century...

16:15.680 --> 16:19.340
that's the best answer 
you could come up with?!

16:24.710 --> 16:27.380
Let go! I can't contain it any longer!

16:49.820 --> 16:50.770
Stop!

16:51.990 --> 16:53.560
You'll die!

17:07.090 --> 17:09.080
What are you talking about, Vash?

17:09.950 --> 17:11.880
Nai is dead.

17:13.170 --> 17:16.890
You killed him.

17:26.460 --> 17:28.220
Give it to me!

17:32.870 --> 17:34.090
Take me back...

17:34.090 --> 17:36.050
Please stop, Nai!

17:36.050 --> 17:37.960
I'll do it.

17:41.250 --> 17:43.200
I will create it!

17:43.200 --> 17:44.040
Nai!

17:44.040 --> 17:49.520
No fear. No pain. No humiliation.

17:49.520 --> 17:56.510
I'll win a place for us...

17:57.880 --> 18:03.160
A paradise... for us...

18:06.730 --> 18:07.810
Nai!

18:09.400 --> 18:13.980
Nai!

18:37.670 --> 18:41.510
<i>It's been two years since 
that fateful July 21st.</i>

18:41.510 --> 18:46.310
<i>A crowd has gathered at what
 used to be the third city of JuLai</i>

18:46.310 --> 18:48.190
<i>to pay their respects.</i>

18:48.910 --> 18:51.070
<i>Even after two years,</i>

18:51.070 --> 18:54.330
<i>the pain of losing their loved ones
 has yet to heal.</i>

18:55.480 --> 18:59.190
<i>The suspect said to have 
murdered 90 percent of the city,</i>

18:59.190 --> 19:02.160
<i>also known as the Humanoid Typhoon,</i>

19:02.160 --> 19:04.840
<i>still remains at large.</i>

19:05.400 --> 19:10.260
<i>That demon turned the whole city
 into a gaping crater overnight.</i>

19:10.260 --> 19:13.980
<i>There is no forgetting the sorrow 
of loved ones taken from you.</i>

19:16.840 --> 19:21.420
<i>The Alliance of Cities has raised
 the bounty on Vash the Stampede</i>

19:21.420 --> 19:26.140
<i>to $$60 billion, the highest in history...</i>

19:26.810 --> 19:30.060
I truly don't comprehend.

19:30.060 --> 19:33.300
Turning Vash the Stampede into a villain?

19:33.300 --> 19:35.200
You're from the Worms...

19:35.200 --> 19:40.100
Thanks to the twins, 
a bridge was cast across the void.

19:40.940 --> 19:43.030
I'm here to give a warning.

19:43.030 --> 19:46.580
Very soon, they'll arrive, 
crossing over the wall of light.

19:46.580 --> 19:48.340
From Earth.

19:51.720 --> 19:55.440
We'll always be watching you.

19:55.440 --> 19:57.490
Wait, what...

20:00.340 --> 20:02.520
<i>Where are you, Stryfe?!</i>

20:02.520 --> 20:05.520
Umm... JuLai.

20:05.520 --> 20:08.900
<i>Keep acting up like this, and they'll 
send you off to the Insurance Society!</i>

20:08.900 --> 20:10.630
The Insurance Society?

20:10.630 --> 20:14.060
<i>Stop by headquarters. 
They're assigning you a newbie.</i>

20:14.060 --> 20:15.130
To me?

20:15.130 --> 20:18.070
<i>Some weirdo who wants to be 
under you, of all people.</i>

20:18.070 --> 20:19.270
A newbie...

20:19.270 --> 20:23.150
<i>I think her name's... Tom? Thompson?</i>

20:23.150 --> 20:26.030
<i>Milly Thompson or something like that.</i>

20:26.030 --> 20:27.590
I see.

20:28.240 --> 20:31.080
<i>Hey, are you listening? Hey!</i>

20:32.920 --> 20:34.920
<i>Hey, Stryfe?</i>

20:36.460 --> 20:38.040
Heya, newbie!

20:53.590 --> 20:55.590
Remember anything yet?

20:56.730 --> 20:59.250
It's okay if you don't.

21:00.600 --> 21:03.440
Seems like you've been through a lot.

21:04.630 --> 21:08.180
It's all right. You're safe here.

21:08.180 --> 21:09.180
Okay...

21:10.430 --> 21:11.740
Eriks?

21:34.520 --> 21:39.250
<i>Will I also become</i>

21:39.250 --> 21:42.090
<i>A nighthawk in flight someday?</i>

21:42.090 --> 21:48.090
<i>Shine, starlight, here at the dawn</i>

21:48.090 --> 21:53.740
<i>Oh, light</i>

22:01.080 --> 22:07.400
<i>A melody blooms by your window</i>

22:07.400 --> 22:13.140
<i>Tomorrow is so far away</i>

22:13.140 --> 22:16.800
<i>But there is a song calling out</i>

22:16.800 --> 22:19.630
<i>To the stars at daybreak</i>

22:19.630 --> 22:25.860
<i>Shine, starlight, here at the dawn</i>

22:25.860 --> 22:27.830
<i>Oh, light</i>

22:27.830 --> 22:33.080
<i>Let's quietly row our boat at dawn</i>

22:33.080 --> 22:38.000
<i>Toward our destination</i>

22:38.490 --> 22:43.960
<i>When we wake up, let's call forth a new wind</i>

22:43.960 --> 22:48.890
<i>To keep up moving forward</i>

22:48.890 --> 22:52.970
<i>I hear a clear voice</i>

22:54.300 --> 23:01.540
<i>I hear a clear voice</i>

23:09.740 --> 23:13.120
Project Pieces of Earth 
now entering phase two.

23:13.120 --> 23:14.940
Drain gate deployment complete.

23:14.940 --> 23:17.140
Releasing experimental warp drive craft.

23:17.140 --> 23:18.130
Wait.

23:18.130 --> 23:20.690
Suspending countdown. Locking command.

23:20.690 --> 23:23.120
Cutting power to spheres one through four.

23:23.120 --> 23:26.750
Place interface changes on the Z axis. 
Amplify 2.7 million times.

23:26.750 --> 23:28.300
I see a fluctuation in the gate.

23:28.300 --> 23:30.200
A... fluctuation?

23:30.200 --> 23:32.880
We're receiving something via subspace.

23:32.880 --> 23:35.300
Give me readings from the entire solar system.

23:35.300 --> 23:37.250
Understood. Right away,

23:37.250 --> 23:39.510
Special Ops Lieutenant Colonel
 Independent Chronica.

23:39.510 --> 23:41.560
The noise is from...

23:42.710 --> 23:44.860
It can't be! Project SEEDS?!
